+### 1. Minimalist "Pick Up & Play" Interface
+* **Game Library First:** Bypasses complex container dashboards and boots directly into a clean, card-based Game Library.
+* **1-Click Game Importer:** Tap the **`+`** icon on the top bar to select any `.exe` from your storage or Downloads. Minilator automatically:
+  * Extracts the game's icon directly from the executable.
+  * Detects the game's title.
+  * Links it to the optimized background container.
+* **Direct Fullscreen Launch (Zero Windows Desktop):** Games launch straight into fullscreen borderless mode (`nogui`). No tiny Windows XP taskbars or virtual mouse trackpads required.
+* **Clean Navigation Drawer:** Unnecessary menus are hidden or grouped under "Containers (Advanced)", leaving only what matters: your games, controls, and essential settings.
 
-Special thanks to all the developers involved in these projects.<br>
-Thank you to all the people who believe in this project.
\ No newline at end of file
+### 2. High-FPS & Performance Engine
+* **Turbo Box64 Dynarec Preset (Default):**
+  * `BOX64_DYNAREC_BIGBLOCK=3`: Mega-block JIT compilation for reduced translation jumps.
+  * `BOX64_DYNAREC_STRONGMEM=0`: Relaxed memory barriers (significant boost in 3D titles).
+  * `BOX64_DYNAREC_SAFEFLAGS=0`: Skips redundant x86 flag recalculations in JIT loops.
+  * Hardware-accelerated ARMv8 NaN handling (`FASTNAN=1`) and hardware rounding (`FASTROUND=1`).
+  * `BOX64_DYNAREC_CALLRET=1` & `BOX64_DYNAREC_FORWARD=1024`: Fast branch/return prediction.
+  * Zero logging overhead (`BOX64_NOBANNER=1`, `BOX64_LOG=0`).
+* **Intelligent CPU Core Affinity (Big & Prime Cores Only):**
+  * Automatically detects Big/LITTLE core topology (e.g. Snapdragon, Dimensity, Tensor).
+  * Pins emulation threads to **Cores 4–7 only**, preventing Cortex-A55/A510 Little cores from bottlenecking framerates.
+* **Async DXVK & GPL Shader Stutter Elimination:**
+  * Enabled `dxvk.gpl = True` and `dxvk.enableAsync = True` to compile shaders smoothly in the background.
+  * `dxgi.syncInterval = 0` for uncapped frame delivery.
+  * `d3d11.maxTessFactor = 8` to clamp performance-draining tessellation on mobile GPUs.
+* **Turnip Driver Acceleration:**
+  * `TU_DEBUG=sysmem,deck_emu,noconform,flushall` with `MESA_VK_WSI_PRESENT_MODE=mailbox` for low-latency triple buffering.
+* **Process Priority:**
+  * Android process elevated to `Process.THREAD_PRIORITY_URGENT_DISPLAY` to prevent OS CPU throttling during gaming sessions.
+
+---
+
+## 🚀 How to Add and Play Games
+
+1. Place your PC game folder or installer in your device's **Downloads** or **Internal Storage**.
+2. Open **Minilator**.
+3. Tap the **`+` (Add Game)** icon on the top action bar.
+4. Select the game's `.exe` file.
+5. The game will instantly appear as a card in your **Game Library** with its authentic icon.
+6. Tap the game card to play immediately!
+
+---
+
+## 🛠️ Building Minilator
+
+### Option A: Cloud Build with GitHub Actions (Recommended)
+This repository includes a pre-configured `.github/workflows/build-minilator.yml`:
+1. Push this repository to your GitHub account.
+2. Go to the **Actions** tab on GitHub.
+3. Select **Build Minilator APK** and click **Run workflow**.
+4. Once completed (approx. 3–5 minutes), download the ready-to-install `.apk` artifact directly!
+
+### Option B: Local Android Studio Build
+* **JDK:** OpenJDK 17
+* **Android SDK:** Compile SDK 35, Min SDK 26, Target SDK 28
+* **Android NDK:** Version `24.0.8215888` (NDK r24)
+* **CMake:** Version `3.22.1`
+
+Run from the terminal:
+```bash
+./gradlew assembleDebug
+```
+The APK will be generated at:
+`app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk`
+
